flowchart TD
  A[Fixed evaluation texts] --> B[Run original representation]
  B --> C[Apply boundary-aware normalization rules]
  C --> D[Run normalized representation]
  D --> E[Compare coverage, OOV, prediction, and status]
  E --> F{Did a correct result regress?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Revert or recheck the rule]
  F -->|No| H{Did an error or undecided case recover?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Prioritize normalization]
  H -->|No| J[Add a rule or data, or record a cleanup candidate]
